# SMS UI Consistency (pages & dashboards)

Read `FRONTEND_GUIDELINES.md` §5 and run `.cursor/skills/sms-ui-consistency/SKILL.md` for new/updated UI.

## Before shipping a page

- [ ] Shell: `max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-8 px-6 sm:px-8` (or justified `max-w-7xl` for wide tables)
- [ ] Title: `font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900`; subtitle `text-slate-500`
- [ ] Cards: `rounded-[32px]` + project shadow; children `rounded-2xl`
- [ ] Stats: live API data only; label uppercase `text-xs`; value `font-extrabold` / `font-mono` for counts
- [ ] Primary button: `bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 … rounded-xl`
- [ ] Icons from `lucide-react` only; motion from `motion/react` only
- [ ] No `alert`/`confirm`; no fake metrics; empty state if no data
- [ ] Nav + `App.tsx` route updated when adding a page

